  "privacyIntro": "Tapaiko Ward helps you find the ward, municipality, district and province of a place in Nepal. This policy explains what the app does with your information. In short: there are no accounts, no ads and no tracking.",
  "privacyLocationTitle": "Location",
  "privacyLocationBody": "If you allow it, the app reads your device's location to find the ward you are in. This happens entirely on your phone. Your location is not sent to us or anyone else, and it is not stored after the app closes. You can turn location access off at any time in your phone's settings; you can still use the app by tapping the map or searching.",
  "privacyNetworkTitle": "Internet requests",
  "privacyNetworkBody": "To show maps and boundaries, the app downloads map tiles from the map provider you choose (OpenStreetMap, OpenTopoMap or Esri), Survey Department boundary files from maps.sandeepkafle.com.np, and population figures from the National Statistics Office census service (censusapi.cbs.gov.np). Like any website, these servers can see your IP address and which map area or municipality was requested. They do not receive your GPS location.",
  "privacyStorageTitle": "Data stored on your phone",
  "privacyStorageBody": "The app saves downloaded maps and boundaries, your settings and a short list of recently viewed places on your phone so it works faster and offline. This data never leaves your phone. You can delete it in Settings, or by uninstalling the app.",
  "privacyNoTrackingTitle": "No accounts, ads or analytics",
  "privacyNoTrackingBody": "The app does not ask you to sign in, does not show ads, and does not use analytics or tracking tools. We do not sell or share any personal information.",
  "privacyChildrenTitle": "Children",
  "privacyChildrenBody": "The app does not knowingly collect personal information from anyone, including children.",
  "privacyChangesTitle": "Changes",
  "privacyChangesBody": "If this policy changes, the updated version will be published in the app and on the store listing.",
  "privacyContactTitle": "Contact",
  "privacyContactBody": "Questions about privacy? Email ward@sandeepkafle.com.np."
